<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RAMS second NIMS issue priced at 65 over BBSW.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RAMS second NIMS issue priced at 65 over BBSW.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>RAMS, one of Australia's largest non-bank home lenders, said on Friday its second issue of Net Interest Margin bonds (NIMs) was priced at 65 basis points over the 30-day bank bill swap rate BBSW.  </p>
<p>The second issue in the NIM Series A bond was formally announced on March 14 and totals A$6.2 million.</p>
<p>The price received for this second issue was the same as the first tranche announced in December and RAMS said it was placed with the same customer base.</p>
<p>--Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
